                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <fieldType>ObjectProvided</fieldType>
            <inputsOnNextNavToAssocScrn>UseStoredValues</inputsOnNextNavToAssocScrn>
            <isRequired>false</isRequired>
            <objectFieldReference>vCase.Technical_Assistance_Contact_at_Customer__c</objectFieldReference>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
        <fields>
            <name>scrnTextReqTypeExplanation</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;What type of request is this?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security &amp;amp; Technical Validation (Post-Demo)&lt;/strong&gt; – Assisting clients with in-depth security questionnaires while ensuring their requirements can be technically supported.&amp;nbsp;Due to accuracy constraints, security questionnaires will only be considered post Demo after-which the prospective client has provided strong interest and provided a proposed infrastructure workflow.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Opportunity/Client Demo&lt;/strong&gt; – Tailor the demo to directly address pain points or business challenges specific to the client. This allows Ergotron to highlight differentiators that make the solution stand out in comparison to competitors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Existing Client Validation &amp;amp; Demo&lt;/strong&gt; – Assess if current assets are being fully utilized and explore optimization opportunities. This allows Ergotron to identify potential enhancements or upgrades that align with the client’s evolving needs since we may be able to give them tailored real examples if they are using assets that are currently reporting utilization data.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-Implementation Review&lt;/strong&gt; – Structure feedback collection with clear objectives, such as usability improvements, adoption challenges, or areas of friction. Use insights gathered to refine future implementations and strengthen client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploring Customer Requirements for Advanced or Custom API Integrations&lt;/strong&gt; – Collaborating with customers looking to enhance their current setup by integrating additional technologies, such as ServiceNow ITSM solutions, Badge Tap functionality, or new feature requests like a Sanitation Reminder. This ensures compatibility with their existing systems and supports their evolving operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Select one ⬇️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
            <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
            <styleProperties>
                <verticalAlignment>
                    <stringValue>top</stringValue>
                </verticalAlignment>
                <width>
                    <stringValue>12</stringValue>
                </width>
            </styleProperties>
        </fields>
